    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nApartment 21, Harbour House, presents a very rare opportunity to acquire an exceptionally spacious penthouse apartment in the heart of Clonmel Town Centre. Occupying a highly desirable position within this established development, this impressive residence combines generous accommodation with an outstanding 31 m² private rooftop terrace, creating a superb outdoor extension to the living space.\n\nOffering an unusually large footprint for a town-centre apartment, the property has been recently enhanced with upgrades to both the kitchen and bathroom areas, together with a new water filtration system and automated door locks. The result is a comfortable and contemporary home which should appeal to those seeking a convenient town-centre home.\n\nThe accommodation is well proportioned and comprises an entrance hallway, generous living room, kitchen/breakfast room, three bedrooms, two of which benefit from en-suite facilities, together with a main bathroom.\n\nA particular highlight of this property is the substantial private rooftop terrace extending to approximately 31 m². Offering excellent potential for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply enjoying some private open-air space, this is a particularly distinctive feature, and one rarely associated with town-centre apartment living.\n\nThe kitchen and bathroom areas have recently been upgraded, while further features include electric heating, mains services, automated door locks and a new water filter system.\n\nThe location is exceptionally convenient, with Clonmel's extensive range of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars and everyday amenities all within easy walking distance. The property also benefits from excellent access to local transport links and the wider town centre, making this an ideal choice for those looking to enjoy a vibrant and convenient town-centre lifestyle."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 2.88m x 3.23m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.16m x 5.02m\n\n\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 4.34m x 4.61m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 6.28m x 3.27m\n\n\nEn-Suite 1 - 1.35m x 2.13m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.37m x 5.50m\n\n\nEn-Suite 2 - 1.87m x 1.43m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.95m x 5.02m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.88m x 1.87m\n\n\nPatio Area - 14.59m x 10.94m\n\n\n"
      },
